    // v13.94.6: NARRATION_LABELS - the 47 keys buildVoiceoverText() splices into the
    // spoken script, for every language, always exported in full.
    //
    // Why this exists separately from UI_LABELS: the compact export below prunes to the
    // PAGE language, which is right for the player but wrong for the builder. The builder
    // synthesises audio for the CONTENT language of each pack - possibly several packs in
    // one build, none of them the page language - and it is the builder's output that is
    // written to disk and never recomputed. Pruned to the page language, every non-English
    // pack had English headings and connectors baked permanently into its .ogg files.
